<title>UK: Siebe declares APV offer unconditional.</title>
<headline>Siebe declares APV offer unconditional.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Siebe Plc declared its agreed offer to acquire the shares in APV not already owned wholly unconditional.</p>
<p>It is expected that the new Siebe shares will be admitted to the official list of the London Stock Exchange at 0730 GMT, Monday on June 9.</p>
<p>The offer will remain open until further notice.</p>
<p>By 1400 GMT on Friday, Siebe owned a total 53.8 percent of APV' issued share capital.</p>
<p>-- London newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
